# Promo clip: UNDERDELVE (slot 01): the Old Lode's nest (as tests/ud_08)
audio on
volume 0 10
overlay_text L 3 160 1 y 01 UNDERDELVE
overlay_text L 3 172 0 l TRIBUTE TO BARBUTA
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 1 0 250 40
wait 30
record_start 01
wav_start 01
hold RIGHT 120
wait 100
cheat boss_ground
cheat pos 60 130
hold RIGHT 48
press B
wait 20
cheat boss_hp 1
press B
wait 180
record_stop
wav_stop
